<main class="privacy">
  <span class="kicker">Privacy</span>
  <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: 28 August 2026</p>

  <p class="summary">This is a personal and professional website. It publishes my work, lets visitors send consultation or collaboration enquiries, and offers optional email newsletters. It does not sell products, take payments, or create a consulting engagement online.</p>

  <h2>Who is responsible for the data?</h2>
  <p>Firat Barca is the controller for personal data collected directly through this website. Contact: <a href="mailto:firatbarca@gmail.com">firatbarca@gmail.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact enquiries</h2>
  <p>If you use the contact form, I receive the name or organisation, email address and message you provide. The purpose is to read and respond to your enquiry, including enquiries about possible consultation or collaboration.</p>
  <p>The legal basis is taking steps at your request before a possible agreement and, where that does not apply, my legitimate interest in responding to professional correspondence. Submitting the form does not create a consultant-client relationship.</p>
  <p>Web3Forms processes the submission and forwards it to my email. The form also uses hCaptcha for abuse prevention. These providers may process technical request information, including an IP address, and may process data outside the European Economic Area under their applicable safeguards. Ordinary enquiries are deleted when no longer needed, normally within 12 months after the last meaningful correspondence, unless an ongoing relationship or legal obligation requires longer retention.</p>

  <h2>Email newsletters</h2>
  <p>If you subscribe, Kit processes your email address, subscription status and evidence associated with the sign-up. The legal basis is your consent. A confirmation email is used when double opt-in is enabled. You can withdraw consent at any time through the unsubscribe link in an email. Kit may retain a minimal suppression record after unsubscribe so that the address is not added again accidentally.</p>

  <h2>Analytics and aggregate page views</h2>
  <p>Cloudflare Web Analytics provides aggregate information such as visits, page views, referring sites, country, device type and performance metrics. Cloudflare states that Web Analytics does not use cookies, <code>localStorage</code> or fingerprinting to measure individual visitors.</p>
  <p>The public page-view counter records only a normalized page path, an aggregate count and an update timestamp in Cloudflare D1. An IP-derived rotating key is used transiently by Cloudflare's rate limiter to reduce abuse; the website does not store the address or the key in the counter database.</p>

  <h2>Hosting, fonts and external links</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted by GitHub Pages. Server and security logs may therefore be processed by GitHub. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives the technical information needed to deliver those files. If you follow an external link, the destination service applies its own privacy notice.</p>

  <h2>Recipients and processors</h2>
  <p>Depending on how you use the site, data may be processed by GitHub, Cloudflare, Web3Forms, hCaptcha, Google, Kit and my email provider. I do not sell personal data. More detailed provider and purpose records are maintained in the site's processor register.</p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>Subject to applicable law, you may ask for access, correction, deletion, restriction or portability of your personal data, or object to particular processing. Where processing is based on consent, you may withdraw it at any time without affecting earlier processing. You may also complain to the data-protection authority responsible for your place of residence or work.</p>

  <h2>Data minimisation and security</h2>
  <p>Please do not send confidential, sensitive or special-category personal data through the general contact form. Reasonable technical and organisational measures are used to limit spam, restrict access and keep the services up to date, but no internet transmission can be guaranteed completely secure.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>This notice will be updated when the site's forms, analytics, providers or purposes materially change. The date above identifies the current version.</p>
